{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bdc78e88de0694d5b49551ea82e4296aae125482cabf053642a636ed71748359",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fad29c79ab64c5e4ba679591b6d5695c3bc70bb395d1832856db280dc7cd369",
      "text": "喂喂？\n辛苦啦，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a10562cd49801a314b2d1a5ca025059f496da8fb8844475aba31b076cc16171",
      "text": "现在我们这边是午休时间。正和High×Joker的\n大家一起看正月里拍的照片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:167209a07cbe0f3a5122087b31678ea0f082f705caa6b87819b70c897a956fc4",
      "text": "然后就聊到了\n对着新年日出说出的抱负。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51fb35fbcdd6624f458f1522b02114ce24a82506b9fdb7df6115b9a522e6f9a1",
      "text": "比如“要让演唱会大获成功！”啦，\n“想把乐器弹得更好！”啦，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afc46e275dd00e79874609b1116b2c75269604e2067192e85818795ebed6c723",
      "text": "结果全是和音乐有关的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73e0c32cb94a2e5b94bbde7caa4210a88741546a33e027137d0638b6c970cee8",
      "text": "大家想的事情全都一样，\n是不是很有青春的感觉？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:120a9a9f5b20a04d497373aa7682713942bc44a9e5f30574dd777b3ec756d9f3",
      "text": "确实很有青春气息呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e0da708a3cae5096cc2dae244b0bffb21d68bbaa2c4a2f7f3c31bc7fa37322a",
      "text": "对吧！我一直都很想做点很有青春感的事，\n所以超开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e97efd8c8650b3fa60eb11becfe4af5109e4581ae7594405caace531ecfc24b",
      "text": "……说起来，●●●●プロデューサー\n今年的抱负是什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f86ca20f4b0142659ba3173bd59dfb82c07da8817096ef8e2d0dbdace9c4bf9",
      "text": "今年也会在制作人\n的工作上好好加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93bbf1ee479a154f1dd9ca3641110b915a7c7073773b54185d9bd7ec1eec6f8f",
      "text": "是让各位偶像\n大放异彩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbf29bdb9c1acf3dee211014cccc5224f4b3b34c7968084f501c1e3282ee12ef",
      "text": "啊哈哈，不愧是●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9037b23c5253b7e852f77872b47e7f967103d2d5d02918536714eeec17595b4e",
      "text": "那我也得为了能作为偶像\n散发更多更强的光彩而加油啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_304_2_3_020_04_09_a:2_3_020_04_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02d4e333d834b105a3a50d68ef76c017cbe0263da8066e752547470314e6bdf1",
      "text": "再次祝我们今年也合作愉快。\n那就等练习时再见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
